# R79 — fourth batch L3 author-loop with CORPUS-CALIBRATED thresholds.
# 8/8 candidates IR-clean — 100% promotion rate, dramatically better than
# the 43-75% range of R68/R70/R73 batches. Methodology lesson: probe the
# operator-value distribution on the actual corpus, then choose thresholds
# at meaningful percentiles, before authoring.
# See round79_low_coverage_targets/calibration.json for distributions.

predicate has_high_red_channel
